# 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on building a complete Business Intelligence solution in Power BI for a bike equipment company.

The dashboard compares:

* ✅ Actual Sales
* ✅ Sales Quotas
* ✅ Salesperson Performance
* ✅ Quarterly Trends
* ✅ Country Performance

---

# 🎯 Main Objectives

✔ Analyze salesperson performance

✔ Compare sales against quotas

✔ Detect top and bottom performers

✔ Visualize sales trends over time

✔ Build an interactive dashboard using slicers and charts

---

