---

# 🧩 Data Model

The project uses the following tables:

| Table      | Description                    |
| ---------- | ------------------------------ |
| Rep        | Salespeople information        |
| Territory  | Sales territories              |
| Sales      | Sales transactions             |
| Quotas     | Quarterly sales quotas         |
| TimePeriod | Year and quarter relationships |

---

# 🔄 Data Transformation Process

## 📥 Import Data

Data was imported from:

* Microsoft Access database
* Excel workbook

---

## 🧹 Power Query Transformations

### Rep Table

* Filter sales employees
* Create full name column

### Sales Table

* Convert OrderDateKey into date format
* Create Year and Quarter columns
* Group sales by:

  * Employee
  * Territory
  * Year
  * Quarter

### Quotas Table

* Append yearly sheets
* Unpivot quarterly columns
* Create TimePeriod field

---

# 🔗 Relationships

The model relationships were created using:

```text
Rep[EmployeeKey] ↔ Sales[EmployeeKey]
Territory[SalesTerritoryKey] ↔ Sales[SalesTerritoryKey]
TimePeriod[TimePeriod] ↔ Sales[TimePeriod]
TimePeriod[TimePeriod] ↔ Quotas[TimePeriod]
```

---

# 📐 DAX Measures

## Total Sales

```DAX
Total Sales = SUM(Sales[Sales Amount])
```

## Total Quota

```DAX
Total Quota = SUM(Quotas[Quota])
```

## Variance

```DAX
Variance = [Total Sales] - [Total Quota]
```

## Percent Variance

```DAX
Percent Variance =
DIVIDE([Variance],[Total Quota],BLANK())
```

